// @error cannot assign boolean to 'r' of type i32 — a `boolean` is not a number; convert it with `b as i32` (parameter `self` of `local`, used at 40:18)
// @error return type mismatch: expected i32, got boolean — a `boolean` is not a number; convert it with `b as i32` (parameter `self` of `ret`, returned at 43:40)
// @error argument 1: expected i32, got boolean — a `boolean` is not a number; convert it with `b as i32` (the call of `h`
